1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
The textbook orbit picture is wrong. This is the real one

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
The Sun does not pull the planets. It warps space-time

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,000
The Sun curves space-time. Earth just follows the straightest path

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Even starlight bends passing the Sun, by 1.75 arcseconds

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
If nothing pulls Earth, why does it not fly off?
